<p>Hi,</p>
<p>
  We tried to charge <strong><%= formatted_amount %></strong> for <%= @organization.name %>'s
  Thomas IT support plan, but the payment didn't go through - usually an expired card or a bank decline.
</p>
<p>
  Your support continues as normal while this gets sorted out.
  <% if next_attempt_on %>We'll automatically try again on <%= next_attempt_on %>.<% end %>
</p>
<p><%= link_to "Update your payment method", billing_url %></p>
<% if @details[:hosted_invoice_url].present? %>
  <p>Or <%= link_to "pay this invoice directly", @details[:hosted_invoice_url] %>.</p>
<% end %>
<p>
  If we can't collect payment after a few tries, the subscription will be canceled and your
  team will lose priority support.
</p>
<p>Questions? Just reply to this email.</p>
